      "question": "Can you have both a Trump Account and a 529 account?",
      "answer": "Yes, a child can have both a Trump Account and a 529. A family can open the Trump Account to collect the $1,000 federal seed and still save for college in a 529. Run your numbers in the calculator above to see which account should get this year's money."
